 Charlotte, North Carolina." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/19/Hawkins-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />Double-digit underdog West Virginia overcame early deficits of 7-0 and 14-7 to upset 25th-ranked Virginia 38-27 in the Duke's Mayo Classic played at Bank of America Stadium in Charlotte, North Carolina.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/Hawkins-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/Hawkins-Main.jpg"><media:title>Michael Hawkins runs for a 13-yard touchdown in the first quarter of West Virginia's Duke's Mayo Classic at Bank America Stadium in Charlotte, North Carolina.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/Hawkins-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 23:19:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59419</s:story_id></item><item><title>FINAL: West Virginia Defeats No. 25 Virginia in Charlotte, 38-27</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/football-game-day-mountaineers-face-no-25-virginia-in-queen-city</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/football-game-day-mountaineers-face-no-25-virginia-in-queen-city</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Quarterback Michael Hawkins Jr. (3) scores a rushing touchdown in the first quarter against No. 25 Virginia at Bank of America Stadium on Sept. 19, 2026, in Charlotte, N.C." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/19/FB_WVUvsVirginia_Sept19_2026_TT-3_NwAe7.jpg" /><br /><br />CHARLOTTE, N.C. — West Virginia defeats No. 25 Virginia Tech, 38-27, at Bank of America Stadium in Charlotte, N.C.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/FB_WVUvsVirginia_Sept19_2026_TT-3_NwAe7.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/FB_WVUvsVirginia_Sept19_2026_TT-3_NwAe7.jpg"><media:title>Quarterback Michael Hawkins Jr. (3) scores a rushing touchdown in the first quarter against No. 25 Virginia at Bank of America Stadium on Sept. 19, 2026, in Charlotte, N.C.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/FB_WVUvsVirginia_Sept19_2026_TT-3_NwAe7.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 18:30:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59412</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Complete UNT Invitational Sweep with a Straight-Set Victory Over Tarleton State</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/volleyball-mountaineers-complete-unt-invitational-sweep-with-a-straight-set-victory-over-tarleton-state</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/19/volleyball-mountaineers-complete-unt-invitational-sweep-with-a-straight-set-victory-over-tarleton-state</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Anna Barr finishes a kill while playing against Tarleton State in the UNT Invitational" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09441.jpg" /><br /><br />DENTON, Texas – The West Virginia University volleyball team (7-3, 0-0 Big 12) earned its first straight-set victory of the season, defeating Tarleton State (4-9, 0-0 United) by set scores of 25-23, 25-22 and 25-21 on Saturday afternoon at the UNT Volleyball Center in Denton, Texas.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09441.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09441.jpg"><media:title>Anna Barr finishes a kill while playing against Tarleton State in the UNT Invitational</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/19/DSC09441.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:32:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59418</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>